{"id":"56e6e33833fc4900","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-constraint-graph.md","title":"二约束实例的约束多重图","display":"df-constraint-graph — 二约束实例的约束多重图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-constraint-graph","aliases":["28-df-constraint-graph"],"display":"df-constraint-graph — 二约束实例的约束多重图","depends_on":["[[28-df-csp-instance]]"],"source_book_location":"§22.2.2 and §22.A","source_printed_pages":"465,491","source_pdf_pages":"491,517","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-constraint-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-constraint-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constraint-graph — 二约束实例的约束多重图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" href=\"?note=b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" title=\"28-df-csp-instance\">28-df-csp-instance</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§22.2.2 and §22.A"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"465,491"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"491,517"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(n,W,2,((i_r,j_r),P_r)_{r=1}^m)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{2,W}\">\\(\\Phi=(n,W,2,((i_r,j_r),P_r)_{r=1}^m)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{2,W}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" href=\"?note=b9a9d2bf0a32514c\" title=\"28-df-csp-instance\">28-df-csp-instance</a>；每个约束保留独立边标号 r。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in[n]\">\\(v\\in[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；自环有两个关联端点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_\\Phi\\coloneqq[n],\\qquad E_\\Phi\\coloneqq[m],\\qquad\\partial_\\Phi(r)\\coloneqq(i_r,j_r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_\\Phi\\coloneqq[n],\\qquad E_\\Phi\\coloneqq[m],\\qquad\\partial_\\Phi(r)\\coloneqq(i_r,j_r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\deg_\\Phi(v)\\coloneqq\\sum_{r=1}^m(\\mathbf1_{\\{i_r\\}}(v)+\\mathbf1_{\\{j_r\\}}(v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Phi;d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in[n]\\;\\deg_\\Phi(v)=d.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\deg_\\Phi(v)\\coloneqq\\sum_{r=1}^m(\\mathbf1_{\\{i_r\\}}(v)+\\mathbf1_{\\{j_r\\}}(v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Phi;d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in[n]\\;\\deg_\\Phi(v)=d.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{v=1}^n\\deg_\\Phi(v)=2m.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{v=1}^n\\deg_\\Phi(v)=2m.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>端点保留顺序以评价 P_r，但底层关联图可视为无向多重图。此处自环按两个端点计度；21章端口自环计一次是不同显示约定，转换时必须把本图自环拆为两个固定端口，不能直接复用数值 d。重复约束必须保留重数。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§22.2.2 and §22.A；印刷页 465,491；PDF 页 491,517。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-csp-instance","status":"resolved","id":"b9a9d2bf0a32514c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-csp-instance","status":"resolved","id":"b9a9d2bf0a32514c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi=(n,W,2,((i_r,j_r),P_r)_{r=1}^m)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{2,W}$，见 [[28-df-csp-instance]]；每个约束保留独立边标号 r。$v\\in[n]$，$d\\in\\mathbb N$；自环有两个关联端点。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi=(n,W,2,((i_r,j_r),P_r)_{r=1}^m)\\in\\mathsf{CSP}_{2,W}","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\Phi\\coloneqq[n],\\qquad E_\\Phi\\coloneqq[m],\\qquad\\partial_\\Phi(r)\\coloneqq(i_r,j_r).","display":true},{"tex":"\\deg_\\Phi(v)\\coloneqq\\sum_{r=1}^m(\\mathbf1_{\\{i_r\\}}(v)+\\mathbf1_{\\{j_r\\}}(v)),\\qquad\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Phi;d)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall v\\in[n]\\;\\deg_\\Phi(v)=d.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sum_{v=1}^n\\deg_\\Phi(v)=2m.","display":true}],"bytes":1593,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":["b9a9d2bf0a32514c"]}